// TopGrade service worker: makes the app installable, instant to open and usable offline.
// Strategy: the app's own files are served straight from the cache (no network wait on launch).
// Each deploy changes VERSION, so the browser installs a new worker with a fresh cache in the
// background; the page switches to it at a safe moment (never mid-quiz) — see assets/js/app/update.js.
// The file list and version below are generated by `npm run build` (tools/build-sw.mjs).

